building_height = 10
door_width = 1
door_height = 2.5
door_depth = 0.05
window_spacing = 3
window_width = 2
window_height = 3
window_depth = 0.05
plot --> comp(f){left : facade | right: facade | front : facade | back : facade | bottom : wall | top : roof}
facade --> split(x){~1 : tiles | door_width*1.5 : entrance} : 0.2
facade --> split(x){door_width*1.5 : entrance | ~1 : tiles} : 0.2
facade --> tiles : 0.6
tiles --> repeat(x){window_spacing : tile}
tile --> split(x){~1 : wall | window_width : split(z){~2 : wall | window_height : win | ~1 : wall} | ~1 : wall}
win --> colour(1,1,1){wall}
entrance --> split(x){~1 : wall | door_width : split(z){door_height : dr | ~1 : wall} | ~1 : wall}
dr --> colour(red){wall}
wall --> I(rect)
roof --> I(pyramid)